DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:28th Annual Global ISAM Congress (ISAM 2026)
DESCRIPTION:The International Society of Addiction Medicine holds its 28t
 h annual global congress in Rotterdam\, Netherlands\, from October 1 to 
 3\, 2026\, at the De Doelen venue. The program is organized around the t
 heme of improving addiction treatment outcomes by addressing established
  and emerging challenges in the field.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract submission
  opens: 2025-10-01 (estimated)\nAbstract submission: 2026-03-31\nAbstrac
 t notification of review outcomes: 2026-06-01 (estimated)\nEarly registr
 ation: 2026-06-30\nTravel award application: 2026-06-01\nRegistration de
 adline for presenting authors: 2026-07-01\nLate-breaking poster submissi
 on opens: 2026-07-01\nLate-breaking abstract submission: 2026-09-01\nLat
 e-breaking presenter registration deadline: 2026-09-20\n\nhttps://www.is
 am2026rotterdam.org/
LOCATION:Rotterdam\, South Holland\, NL\, De Doelen
URL:https://www.isam2026rotterdam.org/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:28th Annual Global ISAM Congress (ISAM 2026)
TRIGGER:-P6DT15H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
