 erdam.org) is treated as authoritative since its stated weekday matches 
 the calendar date.\nMeeting: 28th Annual Global ISAM Congress (ISAM 2026
 )\, Oct 01 to 03\, 2026\, Rotterdam\, South Holland\, NL\, De Doelen\nht
 tps://www.isam2026rotterdam.org/abstract-information/
